er":"original","quote":"乂迁新都、绵竹令，乃心隐恤〖5〗；百姓称之，为一州诸城之首","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":54,"end":83},{"id":"dongliu-q-7761390d5be355c2633c","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-7330a3e47a6e36234511","layer":"original","quote":"父常，送故将（军）刘焉入蜀〖1〗；值王路隔塞，遂不得还","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":38},{"id":"dongliu-q-8f57fcd9f4141626b226","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-57b4fa27082f83eb77d6","layer":"original","quote":"乂募取兵五千人诣亮，慰喻检制〖7〗，无逃窜者","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":45},{"id":"dongliu-q-ad31f4dd28bce9fa7905","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-d9f3c081df9acfb0fd2a","layer":"original","quote":"后校尉王连请乂及南阳杜祺、南乡刘幹等并为典曹都尉","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":50},{"id":"dongliu-q-e1eb9d02d1266d393ab7","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-3fecc4c6954cfd608ab2","layer":"original","quote":"延熙十四年卒","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":96,"end":102},{"id":"dongliu-q-e42ba93f808bd05d0892","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-d9f3c081df9acfb0fd2a","layer":"original","quote":"迁巴西太守","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":84,"end":89},{"id":"dongliu-q-ecd901badd3244fca98b","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-51d878b383cf60747686","layer":"original","quote":"乂到官，为之防禁，开喻劝导；数年之中，漏脱自出者万余口","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":80},{"id":"dongliu-q-f5f215ab387aa80e1ea7","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-741dab246b7a02177d3e","layer":"original","quote":"吕乂卒","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":3},{"id":"dongliu-q2-b8b42f556d17329a85d6","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-3fecc4c6954cfd608ab2","layer":"original","quote":"后入为尚书。代董允为尚书令，众事无留〖11〗，门无停宾〖12〗。乂历职内外，治身俭约，谦靖少言；为政简而不烦，号为清能。然持法刻深〖13〗，好用文俗吏〖14〗；故居大官，名声损于郡县〖15〗。延熙十四年卒。","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103},{"id":"dongliu-q2-eddcfb247936c7b9937b","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-7330a3e47a6e36234511","layer":"original","quote":"吕乂字季阳，南阳人也。父常，送故将（军）刘焉入蜀〖1〗；值王路隔塞，遂不得还。乂少孤，好读书鼓琴。","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49},{"id":"huowang-q-6820315b68719093f7f1","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-32c9d11bbe75c96df1dc","layer":"original","quote":"于是简取良才以为官属，若吕乂、杜祺、刘幹等；终皆至大官，自连所拔也","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":48,"end":81}],"profiles":{"dongliu-p0004":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
